title: 엔딩70_신아산_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(Current time: 12:30 AM.)
(ASan calling me out this late... I wonder if something happened?)
(I ran as fast as I could to the park she mentioned.)
<<show san_idle>>
(I can see ASan in the distance.)
{name()}: ASan!
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_shock>>
<<wait 2>>
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Oh, {name()}!!
ASan: You actually came.
ASan: You look like you ran a marathon, though. Are you okay?
{name()}: *Phew*... Thank goodness....
{name()}: I thought something terrible had happened to you...
ASan: Dummy.
<<show san_idle>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Actually... I called you because I have something to give you.
ASan: Ta-da!
<<hide>>
<<bg 꼼수>>
<<wait 1>>
{name()}: What's this?
ASan: It's a ticket to my show.
<<bg 검은화면>>
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: ...... Just so you know, it's a front-row-center seat.
ASan: Will you come see me?
{name()}: Of course.
{name()}: It's not just anyone's show—
{name()}: It's yours, ASan. I wouldn't miss it.
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Really???????
ASan: Then I'll see you there!!!!
<<hide>>
(And so, holding the precious ticket ASan gave me, I went to see her perform.)
{name()}: 402-22 Seogyo-dong, Mapo-gu, Seoul...
{name()}: This is the place.
(I showed my ticket at the box office and headed inside.)
<<wait 1>>
<<bg 특_공연장>>
<<bgm_stop>>
(It really is the first row.)
(Right in front of where the bass amp is set up.)
Staff: Alright, the show is about to begin!!
Staff: Please give a big hand for...
Staff: 『My Mechanical Romance』!!!!!!!!
(The curtain rose to the sharp cry of an electric guitar.)
<<play 일렉기타>>
<<bg 신아산_진엔딩>>
(She looked a bit nervous, but there was ASan, beaming with a bright smile while clutching her bass.)
(She was always talking about studies and acting like a total eccentric, but...)
(Today, she feels completely different.)
(The black piercings and that lightning-shaped scar...)
(Shining under the stage lights, ASan is a total rock star.)
{name()}: GO ASan! YOU GOT THIS!!!!!!!
(Our eyes met.)
(I could see her mouthing the words to me...)
(Th...ank... you...)
(I... love... you...)
ASan: ~ Casting those distant days far away ~
ASan: ~ Flying toward the brilliant light ~
<<play 공통_환호>>
(And in that moment, under the roaring cheers, ASan and I were no longer just friends.)
(Our hearts had finally synchronized.)
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===